This pack is a draft: it is neither tested with the other community packs nor published until this file is removed.

Why (see abilities/index.ts and the README):
- The mini-boss: a pack scenario cannot use `setAsideModularSetCount` yet, so the modular set Twisted Allegiance takes
  its minion from is not set aside at setup.
- Its default modular sets are Fear No Evil's (Tracksuit Mafia, Cops, Disasters; mini-boss Tombstone or The Owl), which
  are not in the SDK's playable pool yet. Until they are, `scenarios/the-rose-bf.json` recommends Streets of Mayhem, City
  in Chaos and Hell's Kitchen (to be confirmed by the authors).
- Three abilities: Hero Resistance and Rose's Greenhouse's "overdefeated side scheme" (more threat removed than it
  had), and Rose's Greenhouse's "already has steady or stalwart" against its own grant.
Every other ability is scripted; with those three stubbed, `mc-pack test` plays 16/16 games (standard and expert)
without an engine error.
